OL,3,AGovernment condemns 'thuggish'
OL,4,Abehaviour in Portsmouth after second
OL,5,Asmall boats protest of weekend
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne protester tells the BBC people are
OL,8,F"absolutely fed up" with small boat
OL,9,Farrivals and "we don't want it" in
OL,10,FPortsmouth
OL,12,FA government spokesman says: "The right
OL,13,Fto peaceful protest is fundamental to
OL,14,Four democracy, but it must never cross
OL,15,Fa line into disorder"
OL,17,FIt follows a similar protest in Dover
OL,18,Fon Saturday, which led to hours of
OL,19,Fdisruption for travellers
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
