OL,3,AFive dead after Amazon cargo plane
OL,4,Acrashes at Miami airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Amazon Air cargo plane overshot the
OL,7,Frunway while attempting to land at
OL,8,FMiami International Airport, killing
OL,9,Ffive people and seriously injuring five
OL,10,Fmore.
OL,12,FThe Boeing 767-300 cargo aircraft
OL,13,Fcrashed just before 14:00 local time
OL,14,F(19:00 GMT) after departing from Luis
OL,15,FMunoz Marin International Airport in
OL,16,FSan Juan, Puerto Rico. The flight also
OL,17,Fhit several vehicles on the ground.
OL,19,FAmazon said that it is "working closely
OL,20,Fwith local authorities and officials to
OL,21,Funderstand exactly what happened".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
